---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">About Civilized Rides</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-stone">
      <p>
        Civilized Rides is a curated collection of bike routes around the Boston area.
        A ride is considered "civilized" if it meets three criteria:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>A challenging workout</li>
        <li>Beautiful roads and scenery</li>
        <li>Pleasant stops for sightseeing, coffee, or beer</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        Each route has been personally ridden and documented, with suggestions for
        the best places to stop along the way.
      </p>

      <!-- Add more content here as needed -->
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
